            <title>[IGNITE-753] Need to make query results serializable</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-753</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;CacheEntryImpl is not serializable which makes it impossible to serialize query results.&lt;/p&gt;

